{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SenpD8ejwn1795154195.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>隨着天氣正式開始轉冷，前香港小姐冠軍翁嘉穗特意為大家送上「夏日暖意」。她日前於社交平台上載多張在沙灘拍攝的唯美寫真，並發文表示：「趁着今天正式開始感覺寒冷，出一個反差，夏日沙灘造型祝大家在寒冷的天氣，仍感覺溫暖！」</p><p><p><img alt=\"kashuivirginia_1795086604_4033800650263433109_995758007.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BXEQBQNQMQ1795154212.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"kashuivirginia_1795086604_4033800650288830345_995758007.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DSXv2k6Gra1795154219.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"kashuivirginia_1795086604_4033800648955760090_995758007.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026YnyHe0FiZu1795154226.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>曝光的相片中，翁嘉穗狀態大勇，置身於開揚的海邊沙灘取景，身後可見岸邊岩石與連綿山景。她挑選了一件充滿度假風情的白色薄紗長裙，裙身點綴着柔和的淡黃色花卉印花與層次荷葉邊設計，輕盈感十足。其中背面近鏡特寫更將禮服的大露背設計表露無遺，盡顯她白皙緊緻的美背線條。面對鏡頭，翁嘉穗任由海風輕吹一頭棕色長捲髮，既在沙灘漫步回眸微笑，又抬手揚起隨風飛舞的薄紗衣袖，在寒意漸濃的日子裡展現出溫暖又迷人的女神風采。 </p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T03:43:51.134657+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":307,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T02:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T03:35:50.966841+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T03:37:14.549197+00:00","content_hash":"4896808c6bac9ef2f48bdc8d7e2e3ad831baf0354fde44096943b0460aeac543","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T03:43:51.134657+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}